## Параметризованные тесты

```python
import pytest

@pytest.mark.parametrize("status_code,expected_count", [
    ("active", 3),
    ("completed", 2),
    ("failed", 1),
])
def test_filter_by_status(client, create_measurements, status_code, expected_count):
    response = client.get(f"/api/measurements?status={status_code}")
    assert len(response.json()["items"]) == expected_count
```

## Моки

```python
from unittest.mock import patch, MagicMock

def test_upload_image_to_s3(client):
    with patch("services.s3_service.upload_file") as mock_upload:
        mock_upload.return_value = "https://s3.example.com/image.jpg"
        
        response = client.post("/api/images", files={"file": b"image_data"})
        
        assert response.status_code == 200
        mock_upload.assert_called_once()
```

## Асинхронные тесты

```python
import pytest

@pytest.mark.asyncio
